/F1 8.5 Tf
12.5 TL
(   [Problem Statement]: Explain Methods in Python: Instance Methods, Class Methods \(@classmethod\), and Static Methods \(@staticmethod\). Compare signatures, use cases, and factory patterns.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. Comparative Taxonomy of Python Methods:) Tj
T*
(   1. Instance Methods:) Tj
T*
(   - Signature: def method\(self, *args\)) Tj
T*
(   - Binding: Receives the specific object instance as self automatically.) Tj
T*
(   - Purpose: Read and modify instance state \(self.attr\) and class state \(self.__class__.attr\).) Tj
T*
(   2. Class Methods \(@classmethod\):) Tj
T*
(   - Signature: @classmethod def method\(cls, *args\)) Tj
T*
(   - Binding: Receives the class object itself as cls automatically.) Tj
T*
(   - Purpose: Read and modify class-level state. Heavily utilized to implement Alternative) Tj
T*
(   Constructors / Factory Methods.) Tj
T*
(   3. Static Methods \(@staticmethod\):) Tj
T*
(   - Signature: @staticmethod def method\(*args\)) Tj
T*
(   - Binding: Receives neither self nor cls.) Tj
T*
(   - Purpose: Pure utility/helper functions functionally related to the class that do not access) Tj
T*
(   or modify instance or class state.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Python Implementation \(Factory Pattern\):) Tj
T*
(   class DateParser:) Tj
T*
(   def __init__\(self, year: int, month: int, day: int\):) Tj
T*
(   self.year = year) Tj
T*
(   self.month = month) Tj
T*
(   self.day = day) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   def format_iso\(self\) -> str:) Tj
T*
(   """Instance method accessing self.""") Tj
T*
(   return f"{self.year:04d}-{self.month:02d}-{self.day:02d}") Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   @classmethod) Tj
T*
(   def from_string\(cls, date_str: str\) -> 'DateParser':) Tj
T*
(   """Class method factory parsing 'YYYY-MM-DD'.""") Tj
T*
(   y, m, d = map\(int, date_str.split\('-'\)\)) Tj
T*
(   return cls\(y, m, d\) # Instantiates using cls) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   @classmethod) Tj
T*
(   def from_timestamp\(cls, timestamp: float\) -> 'DateParser':) Tj
T*
(   """Alternative class method constructor from POSIX timestamp.""") Tj
T*
(   import time) Tj
T*
(   tm = time.gmtime\(timestamp\)) Tj
T*
(   return cls\(tm.tm_year, tm.tm_mon, tm.tm_mday\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   @staticmethod) Tj
T*
(   def is_leap_year\(year: int\) -> bool:) Tj
T*
(   """Static utility function independent of instance or class state.""") Tj
T*
(   return \(year % 4 == 0 and year % 100 != 0\) or \(year % 400 == 0\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   # Demonstration) Tj
T*
ET

endstream
