/F1 8.5 Tf
12.5 TL
(   [Problem Statement]: Explain Dynamic Attribute Management in Python: hasattr\(\), getattr\(\), setattr\(\), delattr\(\), and the __getattr__ / __setattr__ magic fallback methods.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. Dynamic Meta-Programming Capabilities:) Tj
T*
(   Python objects are open and dynamic. Attributes can be inspected, fetched, assigned, and) Tj
T*
(   deleted at runtime using built-in reflection functions:) Tj
T*
(   - hasattr\(obj, name\): Returns True if attribute name exists on obj or its class hierarchy.) Tj
T*
(   - getattr\(obj, name[, default]\): Returns attribute value; returns default if missing \(or raises) Tj
T*
(   AttributeError\).) Tj
T*
(   - setattr\(obj, name, val\): Sets obj.name = val dynamically.) Tj
T*
(   - delattr\(obj, name\): Deletes attribute from obj.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Fallback Magic Methods:) Tj
T*
(   - __getattr__\(self, name\): Invoked ONLY when an attribute lookup fails in both the instance and) Tj
T*
(   class hierarchy. Enables virtual/computed attributes and dynamic proxy delegation!) Tj
T*
(   - __getattribute__\(self, name\): Invoked unconditionally for EVERY attribute access. Requires) Tj
T*
(   caution to avoid infinite recursion.) Tj
T*
(   - __setattr__\(self, name, val\): Intercepts all attribute assignments.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. Python Code Demonstration:) Tj
T*
(   class DynamicConfigurationProxy:) Tj
T*
(   def __init__\(self, **initial_settings\):) Tj
T*
(   # Must bypass __setattr__ to avoid recursion during initialization) Tj
T*
(   super\(\).__setattr__\('_settings', dict\(initial_settings\)\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   def __getattr__\(self, name: str\):) Tj
T*
(   """Fallback for unmapped attribute lookups.""") Tj
T*
(   if name in self._settings:) Tj
T*
(   return self._settings[name]) Tj
T*
(   # Dynamic default behavior) Tj
T*
(   return f"DEFAULT_CONFIG_VAL_FOR_{name.upper\(\)}") Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   def __setattr__\(self, name: str, value\):) Tj
T*
(   if name == '_settings':) Tj
T*
(   super\(\).__setattr__\(name, value\)) Tj
T*
(   else:) Tj
T*
(   self._settings[name] = value) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   # Demonstration) Tj
T*
(   config = DynamicConfigurationProxy\(database_host="127.0.0.1", port=5432\)) Tj
T*
ET

endstream
