(   1. Children precede parents: Subclasses always appear before their base classes.) Tj
T*
(   2. Parent order preservation: Base classes appear in the exact order listed in the class) Tj
T*
(   header: class D\(B, C\) -> B precedes C.) Tj
T*
(   3. Monotonicity: If Class X precedes Class Y in any parent's MRO, Class X will precede Class Y) Tj
T*
(   in all subclass MROs.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. Python Code Demonstration:) Tj
T*
(   class A:) Tj
T*
(   def ping\(self\):) Tj
T*
(   print\("Ping from A"\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   class B\(A\):) Tj
T*
(   def ping\(self\):) Tj
T*
(   print\("Ping from B"\)) Tj
T*
(   super\(\).ping\(\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   class C\(A\):) Tj
T*
(   def ping\(self\):) Tj
T*
(   print\("Ping from C"\)) Tj
T*
(   super\(\).ping\(\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   class D\(B, C\):) Tj
T*
(   def ping\(self\):) Tj
T*
(   print\("Ping from D"\)) Tj
T*
(   super\(\).ping\(\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   # Demonstration of Cooperative Super Execution) Tj
T*
(   print\("--- Invoking d.ping\(\) with Cooperative Super ---"\)) Tj
T*
(   d = D\(\)) Tj
T*
(   d.ping\(\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   print\("\\n--- Formal Method Resolution Order \(MRO\) of Class D ---"\)) Tj
T*
(   for idx, cls in enumerate\(D.mro\(\), start=1\):) Tj
T*
(   print\(f" Step {idx}: {cls.__name__}"\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   4. Execution Trace Analysis:) Tj
T*
(   1. d.ping\(\) enters D.ping\(\) -> Prints "Ping from D".) Tj
T*
(   2. D calls super\(\).ping\(\) -> Lookups next in MRO: Class B.) Tj
T*
(   3. B.ping\(\) prints "Ping from B" -> calls super\(\).ping\(\).) Tj
T*
(   4. Next in MRO after B is Class C \(NOT class A!\) -> Prints "Ping from C".) Tj
T*
(   5. C.ping\(\) calls super\(\).ping\(\) -> Next in MRO is Class A -> Prints "Ping from A".) Tj
T*
(   6. A.ping\(\) terminates cleanly.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   5. Complexity Analysis:) Tj
T*
(   - MRO Calculation Time: O\(V + E\) linear graph linearization at class creation time.) Tj
T*
(   - Runtime Dispatch Time: O\(1\) index array access.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
