(   [Problem Statement]: Implement the Singleton Design Pattern in Python using both the __new__ override technique and a custom Metaclass. Analyze thread safety considerations.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. The Singleton Design Pattern:) Tj
T*
(   The Singleton pattern ensures that a class has only one instance throughout the entire) Tj
T*
(   application lifecycle, providing a centralized point of access.) Tj
T*
(   Common Use Cases: Database Connection Pools, Configuration Managers, Hardware Device Drivers,) Tj
T*
(   Logging Engines.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Implementation Approaches:) Tj
T*
(   1. Overriding __new__\(\): Intercepts instance allocation; if an instance already exists in a) Tj
T*
(   class variable _instance, returns it instead of creating a new one.) Tj
T*
(   2. Metaclass Singleton: Encapsulates singleton logic inside a reusable metaclass.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. Python Implementation:) Tj
T*
(   # Approach 1: Overriding __new__) Tj
T*
(   class DatabaseConnectionPool:) Tj
T*
(   _instance = None) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   def __new__\(cls, *args, **kwargs\):) Tj
T*
(   if cls._instance is None:) Tj
T*
(   # Allocate the single physical instance) Tj
T*
(   cls._instance = super\(\).__new__\(cls\)) Tj
T*
(   cls._instance._initialized = False) Tj
T*
(   return cls._instance) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   def __init__\(self, connection_url="postgresql://localhost:5432"\):) Tj
T*
(   if not self._initialized:) Tj
T*
(   self.connection_url = connection_url) Tj
T*
(   self._initialized = True) Tj
T*
(   print\(f"[INIT] Database Pool established to {connection_url}"\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   # Approach 2: Reusable Metaclass Singleton) Tj
T*
(   class SingletonMeta\(type\):) Tj
T*
(   _instances = {}) Tj
T*
(   def __call__\(cls, *args, **kwargs\):) Tj
T*
(   if cls not in cls._instances:) Tj
T*
(   cls._instances[cls] = super\(\).__call__\(*args, **kwargs\)) Tj
T*
(   return cls._instances[cls]) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   class AppConfiguration\(metaclass=SingletonMeta\):) Tj
T*
(   def __init__\(self\):) Tj
T*
(   self.theme = "Dark") Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   # Verification) Tj
T*
(   pool1 = DatabaseConnectionPool\(\)) Tj
T*
(   pool2 = DatabaseConnectionPool\(\)) Tj
T*
ET

endstream
