T*
(   order.pay\(\) # Transition to Paid) Tj
T*
(   order.ship\(\) # Transition to Shipped) Tj
T*
(   order.deliver\(\) # Transition to Delivered) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. Complexity Analysis:) Tj
T*
(   - State Transition Time: O\(1\) constant time.) Tj
T*
(   - Space Complexity: O\(1\) state instance references.) Tj
