T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. Theoretical Basis:) Tj
T*
(   - Factory Method: Defines an interface for creating an object, but lets subclasses decide which) Tj
T*
(   class to instantiate.) Tj
T*
(   - Abstract Factory: Provides an interface for creating families of related or dependent objects) Tj
T*
(   without specifying their concrete classes.) Tj
T*
